Memorandum
Honorable Mayor Patrick J. Collins
Members of City Council

March 9, 2022
Page 2 of 2

Cost and Funding:

The total cost of Carlson Street and Powderhouse Improvements to the City of Cheyenne shall
not exceed $177,000.  The funding for the project is the 2019-2022 5th Penny 1% Sales Tax.  The
City Engineer’s Office shall be filing for reimbursement from adjacent developers under
Municipal Code 1.16.080 - Infrastructure improvements - Reimbursement to city.
1.16.080 - Infrastructure improvements—Reimbursement to
city.
